P delivers 500W AC output with 403Wh capacity. A versatile mid-range portable power station for outdoor use and home backup in Kenya.","specs":{"weight":"5.4kg","capacity":"403Wh","ac_output":"700W (Surge 1400W)","chemistry":"LFP"},"images":["/products/bluetti/bluetti-ac50p.jpg"],"price_kes":37500,"compare_price_kes":null,"discount_percent":null,"discount_badge":null,"in_stock":true,"stock_qty":10,"featured":false,"sort_order":101,"meta_title":"Buy Bluetti AC50P in Kenya — Price KES 37,500 | Batteriq","meta_description":"Buy the Bluetti AC50P in Kenya for KES 37,500. 403Wh, 500W AC output. Authorised Bluetti dealer. Instant M-Pesa payment. Fast Nairobi delivery. Batteriq.","schema_rating":4.6,"schema_review_count":19,"created_at":"2026-05-19T11:44:14.287828+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-16T13:11:21.864866+00:00","discount_label":null,"discount_start":null,"discount_end":null,"low_stock_threshold":3,"featured_image":"/products/bluetti/bluetti-ac50p.jpg"},{"id":"aa26d837-d5d0-4443-9176-ee816bae9197","sku":"5015601028","brand":"EcoFlow","category":"Power Stations","subcategory":null,"name":"EcoFlow RIVER 3 Plus","slug":"river-3-plus","description":"The EcoFlow RIVER 3 Plus delivers 286Wh capacity with 600W AC output and sub-10ms UPS switching. Expandable with extra batteries for extended power on the go.","specs":{"ports":7,"weight":"4.2kg","capacity":"286Wh","ac_output":"600W (surge 1200W)","chemistry":"LFP","expandable":"Yes","ups_switch_time":"<10ms"},"images":["/products/ecoflow/river-3-plus.jpg"],"price_kes":41740,"compare_price_kes":null,"discount_percent":null,"discount_badge":null,"in_stock":true,"stock_qty":28,"featured":false,"sort_order":12,"meta_title":"EcoFlow RIVER 3 Plus Kenya — KES 41,740 | Batteriq","meta_description":"Buy the EcoFlow RIVER 3 Plus in Kenya for KES 41,740. 286Wh, 600W AC, <10ms UPS, expandable. Authorised EcoFlow dealer. M-Pesa payment. Nairobi delivery.","schema_rating":4.9,"schema_review_count":11,"created_at":"2026-05-19T11:44:02.8906